":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/chibicc/blob/6c1d254ed44458d56b21bb067c1775d253d096eb/main.go#L45-L67\u003e","ts":"1619777712.044100","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: skanehira/chibicc","id":1,"title":"skanehira/chibicc","title_link":"https://github.com/skanehira/chibicc/blob/6c1d254ed44458d56b21bb067c1775d253d096eb/main.go#L45-L67","text":"Contribute to skanehira/chibicc development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/c00142d659846f46e8af399104da9ba7f7355846f411b19438d8317bdf98cbba/skanehira/chibicc","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/skanehira/chibicc/blob/6c1d254ed44458d56b21bb067c1775d253d096eb/main.go#L45-L67","original_url":"https://github.com/skanehira/chibicc/blob/6c1d254ed44458d56b21bb067c1775d253d096eb/main.go#L45-L67"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rxNmP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58f58555-d1b1-44c2-9cb7-0f9fe1e60288","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```func strol(a string, i *int) string {\n\tvar result []byte\n\tfor *i \u0026lt; len(a) {\n\t\ts := a[*i]\n\t\tif '0' \u0026lt;= s \u0026amp;\u0026amp; s \u0026lt;= '9' {\n\t\t\tresult = append(result, s)\n\t\t\t*i++\n\t\t} else {\n\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn string(result)\n}```\n雑だけど、こんな感じでやりたいことはできた","ts":"1619776684.043700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LGM0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7612307a-92ab-47df-b9ad-5fad939d07e3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Goだと多値を返せるのでそのへん便利できそう","ts":"1619776287.043200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BiB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee9f22f9-1585-452e-b55d-5c9544d1d258","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ひとまず、どうすればいいのかわかったので、代替関数を用意します","ts":"1619776046.042700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vd6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21352f57-fadf-4df9-9a8f-cf40b3d2ab9d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あんまり特性の固執しないで本質を掴むつもりのほうがいいのかな、このへんは","ts":"1619775999.041700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EfbuS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"605b7e9b-f05e-490e-8ad1-5795f1c35fc9","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"正確には返してるわけじゃないですね、第二引数に入れる","ts":"1619775972.041300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bghd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e005f799-14e1-454c-9e09-1206a24522ba","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"なので最初に `p++` してる","ts":"1619775920.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v+odg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd25b535-3c92-4d70-9378-1db220fdcae3","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"`strtol()` は変換不能な文字がくるまで読んで、変換不能な文字へのポインタを返す、とかだった記憶","ts":"1619775899.040100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eu+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01ced7c4-17ee-432b-bb47-9a3977d60cbc","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"それっぽい関数書いて濁すか","ts":"1619775890.039900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QjOw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d45ca1ae-8f64-4631-a5d8-6b01abbe0712","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"基点の理解が間違っていたけど、動き自体はあっているのか","ts":"1619775878.039300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4m3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b10eef9-bf67-4cd1-adf5-2c7811638748","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なる","ts":"1619775860.038500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8rdm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87bc52a2-65e6-40be-a1c7-7c096b7f9be8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"今のポインタ以降の文字列を見て、数値を取り出す\nかな?","ts":"1619775763.037700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WOOj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13142c90-b110-463e-8e5c-abd8968f9258","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"今のポインタが指している値を数値として読み出す、という理解ですがあっていますか？","ts":"1619775657.037200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nmz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf10662a-fe4a-4b69-92de-a995c57f8d5c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"独自に読む必要はあるかもしれないけど、ポインタ進めたら読んでくれるではないような。\n始点が的確な数値だったら読める、ってだけでは?","ts":"1619775551.036600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GyaP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e31d780d-fdd0-4b95-bc53-73e781d3f534","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なので自前でトークナイザを書くしかなさそう","ts":"1619775499.035400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6WCa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d812d6ce-746c-4576-bc10-f56f2d98ed9a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"↑の+とか-はポインタを進めてスキップするので、Goでこのようなものはないすね","ts":"1619775460.034600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q6GU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d81ca7b4-84a0-48c7-8984-ae5c1fc5eddf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```'5+20-4'```\nを渡すとポインタを進めると数値を読み取ってくれるらしいというところまでしかわかっていない","ts":"1619775430.033900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qdy7d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e73e76f-adca-46e6-af64-c27bcbd2892b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちょっとだけ差があるだろうし、あとはうまくフォロー?","ts":"1619775409.033400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C4g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43d0511c-a1aa-4166-b420-06ff4a6f9df5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```#include \u0026lt;stdio.h\u0026gt;\n#include \u0026lt;stdlib.h\u0026gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char **argv) {\n  if (argc != 2) {\n    fprintf(stderr, \"引数の個数が正しくありません\\n\");\n    return 1;\n  }\n\n  char *p = argv[1];\n\n  printf(\".intel_syntax noprefix\\n\");\n  printf(\".globl main\\n\");\n  printf(\"main:\\n\");\n  printf(\"  mov rax, %ld\\n\", strtol(p, \u0026amp;p, 10));\n\n  while (*p) {\n    if (*p == '+') {\n      p++;\n      printf(\"  add rax, %ld\\n\", strtol(p, \u0026amp;p, 10));\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    if (*p == '-') {\n      p++;\n      printf(\"  sub rax, %ld\\n\", strtol(p, \u0026amp;p, 10));\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    fprintf(stderr, \"予期しない文字です: '%c'\\n\", *p);\n    return 1;\n  }\n\n  printf(\"  ret\\n\");\n  return 0;\n}```","ts":"1619775398.033000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AlE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7f80160-c263-47e8-a8e1-21d63dd229cc","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"違うようですね","ts":"1619775387.032700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Jv+n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d740731-d12a-4968-9c24-bb4a755fe24b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自前で頑張るか","ts":"1619775373.032400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0CN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97d9d834-1d4e-48f6-b12b-bcc357273940","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"strconv.Atoi とは違うのかな。","ts":"1619775373.032300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RUQEM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ccdbbbc-e263-4949-851f-5bb7627734d7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"んー、ないっぽい","ts":"1619775358.031800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_origi